// The people aboard, in the order they come aboard.
//
// **The order of this list is load-bearing for replays.** `add_crew`
// takes the next name by index — never by a roll, because a name drawn
// from a stream would perturb that stream and a bark must never be able
// to move an economic roll (`DECISIONS.md` §2). So reordering this file
// is a simulation change, and editing the text of an entry changes the
// content hash. Both are ordinary; both are worth knowing before
// somebody alphabetises it.
//
// Longer than `crew_cap` (8) so a full tower never wraps, and long
// enough to leave headroom for M5's enclave economy. Names are drawn
// from the many places a tower like this walks through, because the
// crew are people who came from somewhere, not a set matched to a
// palette.
CrewNames(
    names: [
        "Wren",
        "Odile",
        "Bakri",
        "Sena",
        "Toma",
        "Ilay",
        "Rook",
        "Mira",
        "Adaeze",
        "Kestrel",
        "Nuray",
        "Solveig",
        "Imre",
        "Palila",
        "Yusra",
        "Ceren",
    ],
)
